# Vercel ignore patterns — exclude heavy dirs, keep what functions & dashboard need

# Build/planning docs
planning/
*.md
!llms.txt
!agents.md
# Runtime API functions read generated Markdown outbox artifacts.
!outbox/*.md
!outbox/**/*.md

# Test suite
tests/

# Hobby-plan function budget: 12 Serverless Functions per deployment.
#
# regional-news and market-watch used to be excluded here to stay under it. That
# kept the count legal but made /api/tools.json lie: the manifest advertises
# regional_news.list at /api/regional-news, and agents following it got a 404.
# api/artifact.py now serves reasoning, track-record, calibration and map-data
# from one function instead of four, which buys the room to deploy them for real.
#
# api/source-health.py does not exist; the entry is kept out rather than carried
# forward. Count with: ls api/*.py | wc -l  (tests/test_vercel_functions.py
# enforces the budget).

# Data — EXCEPT history/ which the theater replay needs
data/*
!data/history/
!data/history/**
# Regional news is baked into the static dashboard at build time via map_data.py /
# src/lib/data.ts. Re-include the whole regional_news dir (the generated latest.json
# is force-committed) so the section renders on Vercel. Ignore the bulky raw RSS cache.
!data/regional_news/
!data/regional_news/**
data/regional_news/raw/
# Coordination graph + intervention state are force-committed and read by the
# Regional Connections page at build time. Un-ignore so the build context has them.
!data/coordination/
!data/intervention_state.json
# Market Watch poller output is force-committed and read by the index page at
# build time (src/lib/data.ts reads data/market_watch/latest.json to populate the
# candle charts + watch-sector / news-context cards).
!data/market_watch/
!data/market_watch/**

# Pipeline source code (not needed at runtime)
cli/
mergers/
watchers/
packagers/
distributors/
.flue/
mcp_adapter/

# Config & infra (not needed at runtime)
.github/
deploy/
vercel.json
.gitignore
requirements.txt
run_pipeline.sh
server.py

# Credentials & local state
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pipeline/
.sent_*.json

# Wizard-created domains (ephemeral)
domains/user-*.json

# Agent verification outputs
output/